# Reedmere Marsh -- wetland route (34x14 blocks = 68x28 steps)
#
# Pitch: an east-west route that drops into a reed-choked lagoon. There are two ways
# across. The slow, wild way is the southern reed bank (LONG_GRASS 80 plus tall grass 03;
# encounters all the way) past a Bug Catcher. The fast way is a zig-zag plank boardwalk
# (89 east-west, a3 north-south) that hops between little islets through the lagoon.
# Two Fishers stand at the corners and watch the planks. The Surf shortcut cuts straight
# across the open water past a Swimmer to a reed island with an item. Small flush pools
# sit in the reed beds on both sides. The top shore has a bank; the other edges meet the
# reeds flush, which reads as marsh rather than as a pond.
# Encounters: 80 and 03 both count as grass. Suggested table: Wooper, Yanma, Oddish,
#   Paras, Psyduck, Marill; fishing in the lagoon. Night: Hoothoot over the reeds.
# Exits: W (0,14), E (67,16), N (58,0) up the east side.
# Attach: between Route 37's east forest and Orchard Road, or as the wild approach to
# Silverbough Estate (marsh N exit -> estate S exit).
# Note: the a3/89 boardwalks are unused in vanilla Johto maps. They render cleanly here,
#   but check them in Polished Map++.
ref Route35
key g=80 B=89 A=a3
grid:
TTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTT..TTT
TTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTT,..,TT
TTTT""ggTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTgg,..ggT
TT""ggg",,(^^^^^^^^^^^^^)gg,,..,gT
TT"gg,,,,,[~~~~~~~~~gg~~]g,,,..ggT
TT,,,.....BBBg~~~~~gBBBBB.......gT
TT,"",.,gg[~~A~~gg~A~~~~]g,,,..,gT
.......,gg[~~A~~g,~A~~~~]ggg,..,,T
TT,"",,ggg[~~A~~~~~A~~~~]g,,,.....
TTggg"gggg[~~,BBBBBg~~~~]gg,,,,ggT
TTg~~ggg"g[~~~~~~~~~~~~~]g~~""ggTT
TTT~~gggg,gg~~~~~~~~~~gggg~~g,,TTT
TTTTgggg,,gggg""ggggg"gggggg,,TTTT
TTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTT
end
exit W 0 14
exit E 67 16
exit N 58 0
obj trainer 26 19 Fisher right 4
obj trainer 38 10 Fisher down 3
obj trainer 44 18 Swimmer left 4
obj trainer 30 25 BugCatcher left 4
obj trainer 12 13 BirdKeeper down 2
obj item 34 15 reed_island_item
obj hidden 57 20 east_reeds
obj hidden 27 10 islet_hidden
obj sign 4 14 MarshSign
